  - assets/icons/furniture.png, ewaste.png, garden.png, debris.png

Step 02: [SERVICE] lib/services/storage_service.dart
  - Handles photo uploads to Firebase Storage buckets (/missed_reports, /special_pickups).
  - Returns public HTTPS download URLs.

Step 03: [MODEL] lib/models/missed_report_model.dart
  - Attributes: reportId, userId, collectionType, scheduledDate, description,
    photoUrl, status, reportedOn[cite: 5].
  - Methods: toMap(), fromMap(DocumentSnapshot doc).

Step 04: [MODEL] lib/models/special_pickup_model.dart
  - Attributes: requestId, userId, wasteType, scheduledDate, timeSlot,
    address, notes, photoUrls (List<String>), status, createdAt[cite: 5].
  - Methods: toMap(), fromMap(DocumentSnapshot doc).

Step 05: [MODEL] lib/models/driver_tracking_model.dart
  - Attributes: driverId, driverName, driverPhone, currentLatitude,
    currentLongitude, destinationLatitude, destinationLongitude, etaMinutes[cite: 5].
  - Methods: toMap(), fromMap(DocumentSnapshot doc).

Step 06: [SERVICE] lib/services/missed_report_service.dart (CRUD 1)[cite: 3]
